  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n60.jpg">
        <tei:pb ed="1965" n="22" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n60.jpg"/>
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="33" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/1" n="1"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n60.jpg" n="22"/>Exult, O righteous ones, in the Lord, it is becoming to the upright to give praise. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/2" n="2"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n60.jpg" n="22"/>Thank the Lord with the zither, with the ten-stringed harp make music to Him. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/3" n="3"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n60.jpg" n="22"/>Sing to Him a new song, pluck the strings well in triumph. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/4" n="4"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n60.jpg" n="22"/>For upright is the word of the Lord and all His work is with faithfulness. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/5" n="5"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n60.jpg" n="22"/>He loves righteousness and justice, the grace of the Lord fills the earth. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/6" n="6"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n60.jpg" n="22"/>Through the word of the Lord were the heavens made and through the breath of His mouth all their host. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/7" n="7"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n60.jpg" n="22"/>He gathers like a heap the waters of the seas, and puts the depths into store-chambers. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/8" n="8"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n60.jpg" n="22"/>The whole earth is afraid before the Lord, before Him do all inhabitants of the world tremble. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/9" n="9"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n60.jpg" n="22"/>For He spoke and it was, He commanded and there it stood. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/10" n="10"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n60.jpg" n="22"/>The Lord has frustrated the plan of nations, baffled the thoughts of peoples. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/11" n="11"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n60.jpg" n="22"/>The counsel of the Lord endures for ever, the thoughts of His heart from generation to generation. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/12" n="12"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n60.jpg" n="22"/>Fortunate the nation whose God is the Lord, the people which He has chosen as His inheritance. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/13" n="13"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n60.jpg" n="22"/>The Lord has looked from heaven, He has seen all the sons of man. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/14" n="14"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n60.jpg" n="22"/>From His dwelling place does He watch over all the inhabitants of the earth. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/15" n="15"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n60.jpg" n="22"/>He who has formed their hearts altogether, He understands all their deeds. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/16" n="16"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n60.jpg" n="22"/>The king is not saved by the size of an army, the warrior will not escape through the measure of strength. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/17" n="17"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n60.jpg" n="22"/>Useless is the horse for victory, by the measure of its might <tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n62.jpg" n="23"/>it will not save. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/18" n="18"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n62.jpg" n="23"/>Behold, the eye of the Lord is towards those who fear Him, those who wait for His grace. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/19" n="19"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n62.jpg" n="23"/>To save their soul from death and to keep them alive in famine. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/20" n="20"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n62.jpg" n="23"/>Our soul has waited for the Lord, He is our help and our shield. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/21" n="21"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n62.jpg" n="23"/>In Him will our heart rejoice, for in His holy Name do we trust. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/22" n="22"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n62.jpg" n="23"/>May Thy grace be upon us, O Lord, since we have waited for Thee. <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
